<title>USA: NYNEX Corp Q4 earnings results.</title>
<headline>NYNEX Corp Q4 earnings results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr     profit  $0.86	   profit $0.55</p>
<p> Net     profit  379,700	 profit 235,600</p>
<p> Revs		3,330,300		3,304,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  439,900		  431,000</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr     profit  $3.38	   loss   $4.34</p>
<p> Net     profit  1,477,000     loss   1,849,900</p>
<p> Revs		13,453,800	     13,406,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  436,900		  426,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fourth quarter 1996 includes $36.8 million post-tax or $0.09 per share for employees who accepted the company's pension plan. Fourth quarter 1995 includes $0.33 per share charge or $143.1 million post tax for pension offer. 1996 results contain net $0.22 per share charge. 1995 contains net charge of $7.61 per share.</p>
</text>
